[WORK]
UID: WORK-SCRIBE-RELATE-FILE-ROLE
TITLE: scribe relate cannot write a File relation
DEPTH: sketch
AUTHORED_BY: llm
STATEMENT: >>>
scribe relate --role File is refused because _relation_type_for_role in
dev/scripts/sdoc_model.py (lines ~349-364) only maps File when the role is
the empty string, while --role '' is refused by _need() in
dev/scripts/scribe_ops.py (~147-148); scribe new carries the "File" -> ""
mapping (scribe_ops.py ~204) and the relate branch lacks it. Found
2026-09-02 while adding File relations to MECH-SDOC-BOARD-GRAMMARS-VIEW for
grammar-groups.json and grammar-groups-check.py; those two relations are
still missing from that node. Likely a one-line fix in the relate branch.
<<<
